{"id":"c9d922648d98305d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-definition.md","title":"Turing Machine Definition","display":"df-tm-definition — Turing Machine Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-definition","aliases":["88-df-tm-definition"],"display":"df-tm-definition — Turing Machine Definition","depends_on":["[[88-df-tm-state]]","[[88-df-tm-alphabet]]","[[88-df-tm-transition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-definition — Turing Machine Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d38664b9a0dc8443\" href=\"?note=d38664b9a0dc8443\" title=\"88-df-tm-state\">88-df-tm-state</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d60bba0b88c24189\" href=\"?note=d60bba0b88c24189\" title=\"88-df-tm-alphabet\">88-df-tm-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0272d8602e3436b1\" href=\"?note=0272d8602e3436b1\" title=\"88-df-tm-transition\">88-df-tm-transition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\">\\(\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\)</span> (state system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d38664b9a0dc8443\" href=\"?note=d38664b9a0dc8443\" title=\"88-df-tm-state\">88-df-tm-state</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMAlphabet}(\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{TMAlphabet}(\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B)\\)</span> (Turing alphabet, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d60bba0b88c24189\" href=\"?note=d60bba0b88c24189\" title=\"88-df-tm-alphabet\">88-df-tm-alphabet</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\)</span> (transition map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0272d8602e3436b1\" href=\"?note=0272d8602e3436b1\" title=\"88-df-tm-transition\">88-df-tm-transition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (candidate machine tuple)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMDefinition}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{TMDefinition}(M)\\)</span> (Turing-machine tuple predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TMDefinition}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TMAlphabet}(\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TMDefinition}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TMAlphabet}(\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Turing机由八元组定义；空白符号是机器数据的一部分</li>\n<li>状态转换函数是核心</li>\n<li>Turing机是可计算性的标准模型</li>\n<li>三个组件谓词共同保证八元组内各次出现的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma\">\\(Q,\\Gamma\\)</span>及停机状态完全一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-tm-state","status":"resolved","id":"d38664b9a0dc8443","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-state]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d60bba0b88c24189","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-transition","status":"resolved","id":"0272d8602e3436b1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-state","status":"resolved","id":"d38664b9a0dc8443","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TMStates}(Q,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})$ (state system, see [[88-df-tm-state]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d60bba0b88c24189","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TMAlphabet}(\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B)$ (Turing alphabet, see [[88-df-tm-alphabet]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-transition","status":"resolved","id":"0272d8602e3436b1","